ink-and-im-settled-in-and-the\" rel=\"nofollow\"><p>Start something completely new</p></a><a class=\"poll-row\" href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/rohirric-hunter/828649643842928640/okay-i-have-my-drink-and-im-settled-in-and-the\" rel=\"nofollow\"><p>Button for ME! No touchy 😤</p></a></div></blockquote>\n<p>Okay I have my drink and I&rsquo;m settled in and the results are clear</p><p>Also I think this is the first time I&rsquo;ve ever posted a poll with a button for me to check the results that no one else clicked on. Good job</p>",
