d\" colspan=\"2\"></td>\n  <td class=\"diff-marker\"></td>\n  <td style=\"color: #202122; font-size: 88%; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-radius: 0.33em; border-color: #a3d3ff; vertical-align: top; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div>The original idea for ''Roy del espacio'' came from Ulises Pérez Aguirre, with Héctor López Carmona as director and cinematographer. Ernesto Cortázar was the films composer. Production of the film was from 1979 to 1982.&lt;ref name=\"Brew\"&gt;{{cite web|url=https://www.cartoonbrew.com/lost-films/roy-de-espacio-mexico-exclusive-clip-266629.html|title=Lost For 40 Years, Mexico’s Third Animated Feature, ‘Roy Del Espacio,’ Is Back With Help From Two Animators|last=Lang|first=Jamie|work=[[Cartoon Brew]]|date=16 September 2026|accessdate=23 September 2026}}&lt;/ref&gt;</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td class=\"diff-empty diff-side-deleted\" colspan=\"2\"></td>\n  <td class=\"diff-marker\"></td>\n  <td style=\"color: #202122; font-size: 88%; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-radius: 0.33em; border-color: #a3d3ff; vertical-align: top; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td class=\"diff-empty diff-side-deleted\" colspan=\"2\"></td>\n  <td class=\"diff-marker\"></td>\n  <td style=\"color: #202122; font-size: 88%; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-radius: 0.33em; border-color: #a3d3ff; vertical-align: top; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div>Multiples scenes of ''Roy del espacio'' were either of retraced scenes of older works or outright using footage without permission. These included the [[Flash Gordon (serial)|1936 ''Flash Gordon'' serial]] and the 1978 Japanese live-action [[space opera]] ''[[Message from Space]].&lt;ref name=\"Brew\"/&gt;</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td class=\"diff-marker\"></td>\n  <td style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; color: #202122; font-size: 88%; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-radius: 0.33em; border-color: #eaecf